---
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.jsx';
import SubNavigation from '../components/SubNavigation.jsx';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.jsx';
import ProjectNav from '../components/ProjectNav.jsx';
import "../styles/global.css";
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
        <title>Fairchild Website | Kassidy Lewis | Graphic Designer</title>
        <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/portfolio/favicon.svg">
    </head>
    <body id="top" class="font-body text-sm md:text-base">
        <header>
            <Navigation />
        </header>
        <main>
            <section class="pt-6 md:pt-12 px-6 md:px-12 xl:px-64">
                <a href="/portfolio/projects/" class="font-semibold hover:text-teal hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-3 transition-all duration-300">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-angles-left mr-1 text-xs"></i>Back to Projects
                </a>
                <h1 class="py-4 font-display text-6xl xl:text-8xl">Fairchild Website</h1>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-[2fr_1fr_2fr] gap-4">
                    <!-- Image grid -->
                    <div class="col-span-3 aspect-video rounded bg-grey/25">
                        <img 
                            src="/portfolio/images/design/fairchild_home.webp" 
                            alt="Mobile and desktop versions of a website homepage shown side-by-side" 
                            class="aspect-video object-cover rounded hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity img-expand"
                        >
                    </div>
                    <div class="aspect-square rounded bg-grey/25">
                        <img 
                            src="/portfolio/images/design/fairchild_industries.webp" 
                            alt="Screenshot of a webpage titled: Industries Served" 
                            class="aspect-square object-cover rounded hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity img-expand"
                        >
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-span-2 rounded bg-grey/25">
                        <img 
                            src="/portfolio/images/design/fairchild_partners.webp" 
                            alt="Screenshot of a 3-column grid on a webpage titled: Line Card. In each column is the logo of a partner company" 
                            class="h-full object-cover rounded hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity img-expand"
                        >
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-span-3 lg:col-span-2 aspect-video rounded bg-grey/25">
                        <img 
                            src="/portfolio/images/design/fairchild_products.webp" 
                            alt="Screenshot of a webpage titled: Product Catalog. Many images of manufacturing equipment are shown" 
                            class="aspect-video object-cover rounded hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity img-expand"
                        >
                    </div>
                    <!-- Image grid end -->
                    <div id="the-objective" class="col-span-3 lg:col-span-1 pt-6 flex">
                        <div class="self-center w-full">
                            <div class="flex justify-between">
                                <h2 class="font-display text-4xl">The Objective</h2>
                                <div class="flex mt-1 gap-2">
                                    <img
                                        src="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-wp.svg"
                                        alt="Logo of WordPress"
                                        class="h-7"
                                    >
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <p class="pt-4 lg:pb-4">Transferring an existing site concept into WordPress format, and tidying up the design.</p>
                            <div class="hidden lg:block -ml-36 h-15 bg-teal mix-blend-exclusion">
                                &nbsp;
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
            <SubNavigation
                link_1="#the-objective"
                label_1="Objective"
                link_2="#the-method"
                label_2="Method"
                link_3="#the-lesson"
                label_3="Lesson"
            />
            <div class="px-6 md:px-24 lg:px-48 2xl:px-96">
                <section id="the-method">
                    <h2 class="font-display text-4xl">The Method</h2>
                    <p class="py-4">This web development project is a new static site design for The Fairchild Company, a manufacturing firm headquartered in Tempe, Arizona. It is based on an existing concept, in which many of the original graphics, colors, etc. were re-used. The live site <a href="https://thefairchildcompany.wordpress.com/" class="font-semibold hover:text-teal hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-3 transition-all duration-300">may be viewed here</a>.</p>
                    <p>Firstly, I met with the company's representative and established a timeline and scope for the project. It would be developed using WordPress's site building platform, allowing anyone with the correct permissions to easily update the site content. It was for this reason that I suggested hosting via WordPress versus maintaining a fully custom site.</p>
                    <div class="py-6 text-center">
                        <div class="aspect-video rounded bg-grey/25">
                            <img 
                                src="/portfolio/images/design/fairchild_compare.webp" 
                                alt="Screenshot of two website home pages shown side by side. On the left is an outdated design, and on the right is the improved version" 
                                class="aspect-video object-cover rounded hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity img-expand"
                            >
                        </div>
                        <p class="pt-2 text-grey">The original Fairchild Company website (left) and the updated design (right).</p>
                    </div>
                    <p>Development from then onwards would be very straightforward, whith the implementation of mobile functionality and basic site features such as forms. The final result is a fresh, modernized version of the outdated design.</p>
                </section>
                <section id="the-lesson" class="py-12">
                    <div class="p-6 rounded bg-grey/10 border-2 border-grey/25">
                        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl">The Lesson</h2>
                        <p class="pt-4">While not my first time utilizing WordPress's site building platform, this project is a bit more complex than what I have built before, and was my first experience using WordPress's plugin library and collaborative features. It would also test my ability to convey these concepts to a client (as they would eventually be editing the site themselves), and to swiftly respond to their feedback.</p>
                    </div>
                </section>
                <ProjectNav
                    src_left="/portfolio/images/design/portfolio_home.webp"
                    alt_left="Mobile and desktop versions of a portfolio website shown side-by-side"
                    link_left="/portfolio/portfolio-site/"
                    name_left="Portfolio Website"
                    src_right="/portfolio/images/design/mockup_desktop.webp"
                    alt_right="Webpage mockup shown on two desktop monitors"
                    link_right="/portfolio/page-mockup/"
                    name_right="Page Mockup"
                />
            </div>
        </main>
        <Footer />
        <!-- Scripts -->
        <script src="https://kit.fontawesome.com/f3040639fe.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
        <script src="../main.js"></script>
        <noscript>Your browser does not support JavaScript!</noscript>
    </body>
</html>